menities you would need. We had a balcony facing the ocean which was also lovely. ||Not so great things about the actual complex itself not the apartment.||- water pressure is terrible and only a bit more than a slow flow. This is a building thing.|- lifts - there are 2 and only 1 is working and from all accounts from the actual residents that there has always been 1 lift only in operation . So for anyone with disability\u2019s that require wheelchair access it could be tiresome because of the wait for a lift. The time it takes for a lift to come can be long and it has a mind of its own.|- noise levels from the inner balconies that face the centre of the buildings can be loud especially if you have a young group or a bunch of drinkers out on the balconies. Everything surrounding the building from people walking past, it\u2019s like a tunnel and the noise can be heard like they are right beside you. And thats what we heard on the 5th floor.", "link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1768794-d21400514-r1055893593?m=68573&staydates=2026_11_22_2026_11_23&uguests=1_2_0&supdv=desktop&supuc=MX&supul=en"}, "source_number": 100532569, "serpapi_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChoIurOFiYHrmu7YARoNL2cvMTFrMWY0NjAyahAB&source_number=100532569"}, {"source": "Trip.com", "source_icon": "https://www.gstatic.com/travel-hotels/branding/b8089cb0-34b4-458c-8749-9bc4614baba4.png", "source_rating": {"score": 4.400000095367432, "max_score": 5}, "reviews": 23, "user_review": {"username": "Trip.com Member", "date": "7 months ago", "rating": {"score": 4.199999809265137, "max_score": 5}, "comment": "Overall a pleasant stay, rooms are spacious the fire alarm rang during our stay at 3 am in the morning though."}, "source_number": 84, "serpapi_link": "https://serpapi.com/search.json?engine=google_hotels_reviews&hl=en&property_token=ChoIurOFiYHrmu7YARoNL2cvMTFrMWY0NjAyahAB&source_number=84"}], "serpapi_google_hotels_reviews_link":